      "specialAbilities": [
        {
          "name": "Machine Gun",
          "type": "ex",
          "description": "These modern firearms have a range increment of 120 feet, automatically reload as a free action, and misfires on a 1 or 2. A viper sniper's core can process scrap metal into new ammunition, effectively giving viper sniper infinite ammo with this weapon.",
          "notes": {
            "familiar": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Full-Auto",
          "type": "ex",
          "description": "Once every 1d4+1 rounds as a full-round action, a viper sniper can use its machine guns to fire twice in one round towards one target. When it does so, it makes two machine gun attack against that target.",
          "notes": {
            "familiar": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Sniper Rifle",
          "type": "ex",
          "description": "These modern firearms have a range increment of 300 feet, automatically reload as a full-round action and misfires on a 1. A viper sniper's core can process scrap metal into new ammunition, effectively giving viper sniper infinite ammo with this weapon. Regardless on when reloading is necessary (a full round action which provokes attacks of opportunity), the sniper rifle can only fire once per round, regardless of your BAB. In addition, you take a -4 penalty to attack to attempting to fire within 30 ft. of the target.",
          "notes": {
            "familiar": ""
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "A Support Unit developed by the Leblanc Syndicate. When the time is right, it can use Full-Auto to deal major damage, and sometimes it can switch over to it's integrated sniper rifle to take long range shots."
    },
